+            <div class="profile-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Clouds, but make them useful</p><h3>Soumya Bani</h3><p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science student at Paderborn University, Germany.</p><p class="label">Interests (the toolchain)</p><ul class="interests"><li>DevOps, AI and Cloud Computing. I enjoy exploring how existing DevOps tools and workflows can be enhanced with AI integration and automation to solve real-world engineering problems.</li></ul></div>
