+            <div class="profile-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Backend with a side of LiDAR</p><h3>Ranjith</h3><p class="study">M.Sc. Electrical Systems Engineering (Signal &amp; Information Processing) at Universität Paderborn.</p><p class="label">Interests (the moving parts)</p><ul class="interests"><li>Python backends and automation (Django, FastAPI, data pipelines)</li><li>Computer vision on real hardware – e.g. sorting recyclables on a conveyor belt</li><li>Reinforcement learning for drone navigation, with LLM-written reward functions</li></ul></div>
